  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short-Term Training Scholarships and ELTO Management Fees FY24-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity Description
This Activity enables Education New Zealand, operational managers of the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme, to contract out the provision of Short-Term Training Scholarships, including ELTO. This Activity represents the pass-through costs which go to third party suppliers and are not paid to or for individual scholars.</narrative>
  </description>
